  "label": "Lazy/Unemployed Characterization",
  "description": "A harmful stereotype that portrays Black people as inherently lazy or unwilling to work, implying they are content with minimal resources and would be thrilled by the prospect of a second-hand store. This stereotype is used to demean and mock Black individuals by associating them with poverty and a lack of ambition.",
